INT: So I'm-- I want to just make this perfectly clear. The trolley, the tram--

HB: The trolley, yeah.

INT: Yeah. The-- the tram went from the ghetto area into the Aryan section?

HB: Yes, through the ghetto.

INT: OK. You--

HB: They liquidated later that, too. We didn't have motor. We got Jewish tram in the ghetto only, not out of the ghetto, which is, I think in the-- in this book, there are trams with a star on the front of the tram. It was with a star. Maybe later, you could see it.

